From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1ma <hello@1ma.ai>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:04:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 1ma: help links and settings point to 1ma

Links and sections that led to bb's site, community and mobile app now go to
1ma or are hidden.

- Help > How to Uninstall opens 1ma's uninstall page on GitHub.
- The Changelog button in Updates opens the 1ma GitHub release of the app
  version (tag desktop/v<version>), including 1ma builds
  (<bb release>-1ma.<build>.<revision>). The inline preview, which fetched bb's
  CHANGELOG.md and showed bb's notes as the app's, is no longer shown.
- The Mobile and Community settings sections are hidden: left out of the
  settings nav, search and command palette, and a direct /settings/mobile or
  /settings/community goes back to General. The ids stay in the section type
  so upstream code keeps compiling.
- The sidebar footer no longer has the built-in Mobile apps button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
